#AREA Tower of Training~
#AUTHORS Desmond~

#HELPS
-1 TOWER_OF_TRAINING_CHANGES~

12.28.04 - 33 spelling corrections. (Mag)
12.28.04 - Removed unused rooms - 3724, 3726, 3727, 3731, 3732, 3736,
           3737, 3741, 3742, 3743, 3744. (Mag)
12.28.04 - Reformatted all mob text to says instead of mpecho. (Mag)
12.28.04 - Changed Grey Lord mprog to mpjunk instead of mpat drop stone. (Mag)
12.28.04 - Modified Recruiter portion of Glathkar quest to make recruiters
           response to keyword vary according to your progress in quest. (Mag)
12.28.04 - Removed unused mobs - 3709, 3713, 3716 (Mag)
12.29.04 - Added code to the Avatar in the training room to offer advice
           based on a char's class.  Set to all_greet_prog to keep from
           spamming the room. (Mag)
12.30.04 - Reformatted all sign text and added color. (Mag)
12.31.04 - Added an etherealtipmob to mpareaecho tips throughout the tower.
           Qbits are used to cycle through the tips. All keywords with
           corresponding help files are CAPS and bold. (Mag)
12.31.04 - Fixed room descriptions that referred to the nonexistent rooms. (Mag)
12.31.04 - Turned down the percentage on rand_progs, may need further
           adjustment. (Mag)
12.31.04 - Adjusted Gargoyle.  Sign says he cannot kill you but he did.  He
           now restores you and himself every round unless you have begun the
           Grey Lord quest or are above level 3. (Mag)
12.31.04 - Modified Grey Lord to vary greetings based on quest status. (Mag)
01.02.05 - Added items 3724 & 3725.  Items are +1 Wis & Con.  They drop when
           either recruiter is killed. (Mag)
~

-1 TOWER TRAINING NEWBIE~

