{000}.{044}.................................................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}The Tower of Training is the place where new adventurers would{044}..{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}kill their first mob or be killed for the very first time.{044}......{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.................................................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}Some important tips:{044}............................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}......{074}Don't rush into leveling.{044}..................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}......{074}Learn to use the help command.{044}.............................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}......{074}Read the help files.{044}.......................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}......{074}HELP is the most powerful command in this MUD. Use it!{044}.....{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}......{074}NEWCHAT is also a powerful command!{044}........................{033}  {020}
