#RANGES 1 5 1 10
#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_FREEQUIT
#MOBILES
#3700
avatar recruiter fasttalker~
The Recruiter of Order~
An Avatar of Order is here attempting to persuade you to follow Order.~
The recruiter is a friendly looking man with blond hair and blue eyes. His 
vestments are pure white and crisply cut. The Avatar radiates an aura of pure 
power and is very persuasive.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND
1000 S
50 0 0 1d1+3026 2d4+100
0 269671
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 99~
  say Welcome! Make yourself comfortable.
  say I'm here to TELL you about what Order
  say stands for and what he can do for you.
~
>speech_prog tell~
  say Ah! But there's so much to say!
  say I can explain the PHILOSOPHY of Order.
  say I can also explain the BENEFITS of joining.
~
>speech_prog philosophy~
  say Order is the embodiment of stability and reason.
  say Without Order there would be nothing to guide
  say society to an improved state.
  say Also, it is Order who upholds justice and law.
  say If we didn't have these things, we would be no
  say better than the animals.
~
>speech_prog benefits~
  say I just know you will be excited about this.
  say When you JOIN Order, you are granted instant
  say communication to all other followers.
  say You receive a white gold chain that is priceless
  say just in protective value alone!
  say Plus, you receive the ability to destroy Chaos
  say followers in order to protect our fair land from
  say their corruption.
~
>speech_prog join~
  say I'm so glad you asked me how!
  say A tower on this plane houses the Test of Reason.
  say If you manage to pass the test, you will
  say automatically be inducted into our ranks!
~
>speech_prog thanks~
  smile
  say Don't thank me now!
  say I hope to see you at our annual meetings!
~
>speech_prog p the other recruiter set the grey lord free~
  if quest(0,3,$n) == 3
    say I have dealt with the traitor.
    say Thank you for your help.
  else
    if quest(0,3,$n) < 2
      say WHAT?
      mpecho The Recruiter of Order utters the words, 'glmpesd'.
      mpecho The Recruiter of Order laughs nervously.
      say You must have been misinformed.
      say You better go practice some more.
    else
      if quest(0,3,$n) == 2
        gasp 
        say Thank you for the information.
        say Come and watch me slay the traitor if you wish.
        mpmset $n quest 0 3 3
        mpecho The Recruiter of Order rushes off to the east.
        mpquiet on
        mpgoto 3725
        mpquiet off
        shout Traitor of Chaos! You broke the pact!
        mpkill sleezebag
      else
        if quest(0,3,$n) == 5
          say That may have worked once.
          say But it won't work again.
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
~
>speech_prog defective~
  say The token is defective?
  say Give it to me and if it is I'll replace it.
~
>give_prog I3715~
  say You're right. Here's a new token. Sorry.
  mpjunk I3715
  mpoload 3722
  give I3722 $n
~
>death_prog 100~
  say Lord Order will punish you for this!
  groan 
  mpquiet on
  mpoload 3724
  drop all
  mpquiet off
  mpecho The Recruiter of Chaos utters the words, 'agem pzar'.
  restore sleezebag
  mpecho The Recruiter of Chaos' wounds disappear.
  mpforce sleezebag grin
  mpecho {030}The Recruiter of Chaos says 'Let that be a lesson to you, traitor.'{020}
  mpecho The Recruiter of Chaos leaves east.
  mpquiet on
  mptransfer sleezebag 3725
  mpquiet off
~
|

#3701
gargoyle~
the gargoyle~
The Gargoyle is here looking for revenge against his captors.~
He is big with skin the consistency of bark and sharp, bloody talons.  You 
don't want to fight him when he isn't locked up in a force cage. Perhaps 
now would be a good time to flee from him!!!  If you don't flee, you would 
really suffer the consequences.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA
AFF_DETECT_INVIS
0 S
5 0 0 1d1+50 1d1+3
0 631
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>fight_prog 100~
  if quest(0,3,$n) < 1
    if level($n) < 4
      mpquiet on
      restore $n
      restore self
      mpquiet off
    endif
  endif
~
|

