AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND
0 S
5 0 0 5d5+55 1d6+3
50 631
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>greet_prog 99~
  say Greetings $n.
~
>fight_prog 99~
  mpecho {130}The chief minion shouts 'Wait! Don't kill me!'{020}
~
>rand_prog 15~
  if quest(0,3,$n) == 0
    say You must ask me about the GREY LORD.
  else
    if quest(0,3,$n) == 1
      say Please hurry.
      say You must help my master.
    else
      if quest(0,3,$n) == 5
        say I have been told you helped my master.
        say Thank you.
      endif
    endif        
  endif
~
>speech_prog p grey lord~
  say The Grey Lord was the God of Neutrality.
  say He helped keep the balance between Order and Chaos.
  say But Order and Chaos didn't want perfect balance.
  say They joined together and stripped him of his power.
  say They locked him in this TOWER and torture him even now.
~
>speech_prog tower~
  say I don't know exactly where to find him.
  say But I was able to steal a key to his prison.
  say If you HELP him, I am sure he will do you a 
  say favor you will never forget.
~
>speech_prog help~
  say If you agree to help him, I will give you the key.
  say Will you help my master?
  say If so, tell me to GIVE the key.
~
>speech_prog give~
  if quest(0,3,$n) == 0
    mpmset $n quest 0 3 1
    mpquiet on
    mpoload 3719
    cast 'giant strength' $n
    mpquiet off
    give i3719 $n
    say Use it wisely.
    say Thank you for your help $n.
  else
    say But I already gave it to you!
  endif
~
|

