>greet_prog 99~
  say Welcome! Make yourself comfortable.
  say I'm here to TELL you about what Chaos
  say stands for and what Chaos can do for you.
~
>speech_prog tell~
  say Ah! But there's so much to say!
  say I can explain the PHILOSOPHY of Chaos.
  say I can also explain the BENEFITS of joining.
~
>speech_prog philosophy~
  say Chaos is the embodiment of change and entropy.
  say Without Chaos society would be stagnant, with
  say no change for better or worse.
  say It is Chaos who casts down unfair laws and
  say punishes the guilty. Without Chaos, we would
  say all be living the most boring life imaginable.
