    say The mark of my servant is not upon you.
    say Leave me to my torment.
  else
    if quest(0,3,$n) == 1
      say Are you here to AID me?
    else
      if quest(0,3,$n) == 2
        say Hurry! Time is short.
      else
        if quest(0,3,$n) > 2
          cackle
          say Thank you for your help with the recruiters.
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
~
>rand_prog 15~
  mpasound From somewhere nearby you hear a voice scream in agony!
  mpecho The Grey Lord cries out in pain and agony!
~
>speech_prog aid~
  mpecho The Grey Lord narrows his eyes and examines you carefully.
  if quest(0,3,$n) == 1
    mpecho The Grey Lord sighs in relief.
    say I am glad my servant was able to find you.
    say I cannot escape, but with your help I can get revenge.
    say The first step is to CONCEAL myself from the recruiters.
  else
    say The mark of my servant is not upon you.
    say If you helped me before, I am sorry I do not remember.
    say If you are a thief I warn you: if you attempt to
    say harm me you will regret it.
  endif
~
>speech_prog conceal~
  mpecho The Grey Lord narrows his eyes and examines you again.
  if quest(0,3,$n) == 1
    say There was a time when I was master of this tower and 
    say its contents.  Then the thrice damned servants of Order
    say and Chaos joined together to strip me of my powers.
    say As I was captured I managed to hide a powerful Stone
    say of Concealment in one of the force cages.  Find it and
    say give it to me so I can implement the next step of my plan.
  else
    say Have you been spying on one of my helpers?
    say I see no mark upon you. Begone before it is too late!'
  endif
~
>give_prog I3720~
  if quest(0,3,$n) == 1
    say At last!
    mpecho The Grey Lord utters the words 'dsepmlg'. 
    mpecho The Stone of Concealment begins to glow brightly!
    mpmset $n quest 0 3 2
    say Hurry!
    say Since they cannot detect my presence it will
    say be simple to instigate a fight.
    say Tell either of the recruiters that:
    say "The other recruiter set the grey lord free"
    say Return afterward and I will REWARD you handsomely.
    mpjunk i3720
  else
    say At last, the stone!
    mpecho The Grey Lord narrows his eyes and examines you.
    say You do not have the mark of one of my helpers.
    say Are you a spy for Chaos and Order?
    say You will get no information from me.
  endif
  mpjunk i3720
~
>speech_prog reward~
  if quest(0,3,$n) < 3
    say You haven't fulfilled your part of the bargain yet.
  else
    if quest(0,3,$n) == 5
      say You have helped me already.
      say I can't thank you enough.
    else 
      if quest(0,3,$n) > 2
      if quest(0,3,$n) < 5
        say I am happy enough now to last another 1000 years of this
        say torture. Let me reward you by giving you this rune dagger.
        say It is weak, but will help to keep you safe from harm.
        mpoload 3721
        mpmset $n quest 0 3 5
        give I3721 $n
        say Now leave me to my torment.
        if actorhasobjnum(3719)
          mpforce $n give I3719 lord
          mpjunk I3719
        endif
      endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
~
|

