{000}.{044}.......................................................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}To move around, use the commands:                                    {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}......{074}NORTH, SOUTH, EAST, WEST, DOWN                                  {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.......................................................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}These commands, like all commands, can be shortened to a few letters.{044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}Some commands work with less than 3 letters, nearly all work with 3. {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}Direction commands are used often and can be typed with one letter.  {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}Therefore, to move around, simply enter:                             {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}......{074}N, S, E, W, U, D                                                {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.......................................................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}Type HELP NEWBIE.  When you are done reading it, type DOWN or D to go{044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}to the next room.                                                    {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.......................................................................{033}
