{000}.{044}.{074}Generally, a primary attribute costs three practice sessions  {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}to train.  Any other attribute costs five sessions.           {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}................................................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}........{074}TRAIN - Show practices you have and what is trainable. {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}TRAIN <attr> - Train attribute identified by first 3 letters. {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}................................................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}....{074}(These commands only function while in a training room.)   {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}................................................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}Type HELP TRAIN for more information about training.          {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}HELP STATS and HELP PRIMARY have information about attributes.{044}.{033}  {020}  
{000}.{044}................................................................{033}  {020}
