{000}.{044}................................................................{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}Here you can learn your skills.  You cannot learn skills until{044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}you reach your third level.  To see how practice sessions you {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}have, your current knowledge level, and skills available type {044}.{033}  {020}
{000}.{044}.{074}PRACTICE.  You will be able to practice your skills and spells{044}.{033}  {020}
